;temp
1,(Roached!) ATAR IDIM AKA: I command thee--this person is to be slandered. {img src="http://www.bullypulpitgames.com/images/products/roach.gif" }
1,(Roached!) NI SIP-RI: Terrify this person, so be it. {img src="http://www.bullypulpitgames.com/images/products/roach.gif" }
1,(Roached!)ZU IGIXSE LI-LI:  Laugh with joy; for you are in the presence of your master. {img src="http://www.bullypulpitgames.com/images/products/roach.gif" }
1,(Roached!) SADULLA SADI DIRIG: It is the secret will of the Gods that you should overflow with joy. {img src="http://www.bullypulpitgames.com/images/products/roach.gif" }
1,(Roached!) NIZU-PA NAMKUR-LA: May it never be that this person is raised up--humiliate and mock it. {img src="http://www.bullypulpitgames.com/images/products/roach.gif" }
1,(Roached!) KUSU BARULTAG: My dog chain is upon you and you will now crawl. {img src="http://www.bullypulpitgames.com/images/products/roach.gif" }
1,(Roached!) GU-UD: Dance, lowly maggot! {img src="http://www.bullypulpitgames.com/images/products/roach.gif" }
1,(Roached!) SA-UR DEENANAMAAM: Eat until you burst--thus shall it be, indeed. {img src="http://www.bullypulpitgames.com/images/products/roach.gif" }
1,(Roached!) IGIU EA: Face the sunrise and praise your master. {img src="http://www.bullypulpitgames.com/images/products/roach.gif" }
1,NAMSILIG NANAL: It is disastrous and you shall know only terror (Lower your personal die size by one for this entire event) || INTIMIDATE: Choose one NPC or group that is supporting an opponent in each Scene during this Event, and add them to your side.
1,LUL-DUG: You must practice deception and betray this person. || UNIVERSITY AWARD: Gain a point of Reputation.

